<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 28.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing</p>
<p>rates for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Aug  28     Aug 27	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  236.650     235.730     237.040   -0.16 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.945     159.945     165.490   -3.35 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.690	46.736	48.410   -3.55 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  368.420     367.840     366.280    0.58 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  197.850     198.300     206.030   -3.97 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.650     142.705     147.886   -3.54 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.624	15.620	14.975    4.33 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.390     218.780     230.135   -5.10 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  300.900     300.900     303.640   -0.90 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.892	 1.890	 1.939   -2.42 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.559	 1.559	 1.575   -1.02 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
